te language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le04ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Starting a Conversation With Someone You Know"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Remember in English, there are certain expressions and words you use to greet and start a conversation with someone you know. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Review the charts below. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Saying \u2018Hello'\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Follow-up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Hi!</li> <li>Hello!</li> <li>Hey!</li> <li>Hiya!</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>It's   <span class=\\\"strong\\\">great</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">nice</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">good</span>   to see you</li>  <li>It's been <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ages/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">a while</span>.</li>  <li>You look <span class=\\\"strong\\\">well/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">good</span>!</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>And you!</li> <li>You too!</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>How are you doing?</li> <li>How are things?</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Good, thanks.</li> <li>Very well, thanks.</li> <li>Not too bad, thanks.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking for Clarification"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Remember when you don't understand what was said, or something was not clear to you? It is, therefore, important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expressing lack of understanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking for clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Sorry, I am not sure I am following you.</li>  <li>I beg your pardon, but I don't quite understand. </li> <li>I'm not sure I know what you mean.</li> <li>I'm not sure I follow you.</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <ul><li>Could you elaborate on that? </li> <li>Could you be more specific?</li> <li>Could you repeat that, please? </li> <li>Could you clarify that, please?</li> <li>Do you mean ... ? </li> <li>What do you mean?</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "multinational"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in many different countries "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They are a multinational company. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le04ob11aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "tex