 mom! This new job is really demanding. I've been working long hours and haven't had much time to socialize and all.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter's Mom</span>: I know what you mean, Peter. Just take good care of yourself and don't work too hard. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, mom. I won't."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}